    "text_full": "Cookie Settings\nMain Content\nMain Menu\nSEARCH\nMENU\nPeople\nPractices\nInsights\nOur People\nOur People\n\nWe are a nexus here, and we know an exceptional amount about the industries in which we focus. What follows are our observations and insights into the most pressing issues our clients face, both today and beyond.\n\nA powerful presence.\n\nOur passionate approach and intentional focus have allowed us to become a household name among industry giants.\n\nIn the spotlight.\nSarah E. Amick\nSpecial Counsel\n\nSarah discussed the Toxic Substances Control Act and federal and state chemical regulations with Bloomberg Law.\n\nRead more\nTimothy C. Brightbill\nPartner\n\nTim was quoted by The New York Times, Washington Post, Axios, and POLITICO regarding the overturning of the Trump Administration's 10% global tariff.\n\nRead more\nColin J. Cloherty\nPartner\n\nColin spoke with POLITICO about Florida's regulation of college sports agents.\n\nRead more\nGreta M. Peisch\nPartner\n\nGreta quoted by POLITICO regarding the Trump Administration's ongoing efforts to impose tariffs on U.S. imports.\n\nRead more\nPeople\nPractices\nInsights\nFirm\nCareers\nInclusion and Engagement\nHome\nSite Map\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nCookies Policy & Settings\nCalifornia Privacy Notice\n© 2026 Wiley Rein LLP All Rights Reserved.\nSubscribe\n\nOur Site uses cookies to improve your experience. Cookies may collect your personal information, such as IP address or device identifier, which we may disclose to our analytics partners. You may opt out of the cookies that are not strictly necessary if you wish. By using this site, you agree to our updated Privacy Policy, Terms & Conditions, and Cookies Policy.\n\nCUSTOMIZE COOKIE CHOICES\nREJECT ALL COOKIES\nACCEPT ALL COOKIES"
